              demonstrated exercise habits over the past year.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Choosing a NordicTrack flagship without budgeting for the
              iFit subscription that unlocks most of its standout
              features.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Skipping white-glove delivery and underestimating the
              difficulty of assembling a 300-plus pound machine solo.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Not measuring ceiling clearance for incline trainers before
              ordering, especially for extreme-incline models.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-black">&bull;</span>
              Assuming higher price always means a better fit, rather than
              matching the specific strength being paid for to actual
              training needs.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
