        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Spending over $2,500 on a treadmill is justified for a specific,
          identifiable buyer: frequent runners, multi-user households
          putting heavy sustained wear on a machine, and anyone whose
          training genuinely benefits from extreme incline range or
          club-grade ride quality. If that's you, the
          <strong class="text-white">NordicTrack X22i</strong> is the most
          accessible entry point for incline-focused training, while the
          <strong class="text-white">Life Fitness T3</strong> and
